WEBVTT

00:10:59.738 --> 00:11:04.410
here are some steps to help you implement
fair-chance hiring in your organization.

00:11:05.119 --> 00:11:06.286
First of all ...

00:11:07.037 --> 00:11:10.457
consider the qualifications
for a candidate

00:11:10.457 --> 00:11:13.794
based on the role
that they're applying for.

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.130
It sounds obvious when I say it --

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:19.967
hire someone for the skills
needed for a job.

00:11:19.967 --> 00:11:21.218
But the fact of the matter

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:25.931
is justice-involved individuals
are excluded from opportunities

00:11:25.931 --> 00:11:27.474
for trivial reasons.

00:11:27.474 --> 00:11:28.642
For example,

00:11:28.684 --> 00:11:32.855
if you're hiring somebody in an IT role
that calls for coding experience ...